{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13113010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13113010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311301001:0":{"text":"...다들 괜찮아? 다치진 않았어?","source_cn":"……你们还好吗？受伤了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDDD8908B66462C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311301002:0":{"text":"여기가... 어디지? 환상 같고 신비한 느낌이 드는 걸 보니 현실은 아닌 것 같은데.","source_cn":"我们……在哪？这是什么地方？看起来虚幻又神秘，就像不在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DAC32323819442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311301003:0":{"text":"그리고 이 문... 이렇게 거대한 문은 본 적이 없어...","source_cn":"还有这扇门……我从来没有见过这样巨大的门……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE1202D1FC94F249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311301004:0":{"text":"지옥의 문은 아니겠죠?! 설마 우리... 죽은 건가요?","source_cn":"这！这不会是地狱之门吧？！我们……死了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x136B4B146AE3E189","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311301005:0":{"text":"진짜로 현실 세계 속은 아닌 것 같아요... 음, 하지만 어떤 책에서도 이런 문은 본 적이 없었는데!","source_cn":"我们好像真的不在现实世界里……唔，可我也没在任何书里看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB37AF80F6E569A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title